producible in 4.6 beta2\n\n### System information\n\nCachyOS, Hyprland WM, Nvidia RTX 5090\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the Project Manager, if you \"Open In File Manager\", the Project Manager seems to freeze and no longer get graphical updates until the file manager is closed.\n\nDesired behavior is that the Project Manager would still continue to function normally after performing this action.\n\nVideo demonstration here:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68132ca8-8999-4558-b6ef-062fc70c35f9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start Godot\n2. Right click on a project > \"Open In File Manager\"\n3. Attempt to interact with the Project Manager (resize, click, etc) and nothing updates/redraws.\n4. Closing the file manager immediately restores the normal/expected behavior.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.